abstract: "A Lean 4 formalization of a conditional route toward the Beal Conjecture. Version 8.3.0 carries typed Taylor-Wiles patching data, derives odd-prime exact conductor divisibility from a canonical Frey model through an explicit Tate boundary, and exposes the terminal 2-adic exponent-one certificate as data. The final theorem remains conditional on three named mathematical interfaces and two explicit data suppliers; this release does not claim an unconditional proof of Beal's Conjecture."
